# M4.29.2 prestart — legacy SSOT checksum mismatch

Date: 2026-08-28

## Finding

A read-only prestart verification as `chatops` returned non-zero for
`/etc/tu1nz/ssot.checksum`. The file predates M4.29.2 and is already stale.
Changing or regenerating it is not required for, and would broaden, this
maintenance transaction.

## Safety decision

The new Control observer and external Integrity state are authoritative for
this sprint. `tu1nz_agent_health.sh` continues to report the legacy mismatch
explicitly but treats it as a warning rather than overriding a successful
read-only Control check. No legacy checksum file is edited or deleted.

## Impact

- server mutation from this check: none;
- services: remain stopped;
- Control: unchanged;
- Adult Candidate: unchanged and never started.

The warning remains a separately visible residual legacy risk.
